只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"US stock market data tools for DeepSeek Harness, powered by yahoo-finance2","id":"gh:1334320668","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-us-stocks","slug":"Realyujie/dsh-us-stocks","topics":["ai-agents","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","market-data","stock-market","typescript","us-stocks","yahoo-finance"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"US stock market data tools for DeepSeek Harness, powered by yahoo-finance2"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-us-stocks"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"US stock market data tools for DeepSeek Harness, powered by yahoo-finance2."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Gives the agent six first-class tools for quotes, price history, financial statements, analyst conse"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nsus, news and ownership — instead of leaving it to improvise against HTML pages."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Before and after"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"One agent turn, same question, same model, same machine — the only variable is whether the plugin is"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" installed. The task: *price, three-month trend, recent quarterly financials, analyst rating and rec"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"k: *price, three-month trend, recent quarterly financials, analyst rating and recent news for AAPL.*"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| | Without this plugin | With this plugin |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Steps | 14 | 2 |\n| Tool calls | 31 | 5 |\n| Wall clock | 213.5s | 33.2s |\n| What it called | 16 × `"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"web_search`, 15 × `bash` | one call to each tool the task needed |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"With no market-data tool available, the agent falls back on web search and shell commands, fetching "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"and parsing one page at a time. Most of the remaining 33 seconds is model inference, which no plugin"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" controls; data retrieval itself is 2.6s."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Acceptance benchmark — AAPL"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Reproduce with `npm run benchmark`, optionally against another ticker: `npm run benchmark -- TTMI`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### The lazy way"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Say it to your DeepSeek Harness:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The agent reads this README and runs the command itself. It will ask for filesystem permission on th"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"e way, because the profile directory sits outside the session workspace."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### By hand"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"If `dsh` is on your `PATH`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"If it is not — which is the case when Harness was started through `npx`, since the binary then only "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"exists in the npx cache — call it through `npx` instead:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Every command below works the same way: prefix it with `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh` in place of `dsh`, or "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"install the CLI globally once with `npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh` and use the short form througho"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"tall the CLI globally once with `npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh` and use the short form throughout."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"To update later:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Restart the profile afterwards — plugins are resolved when the tree is composed at boot."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For local development, point the profile at a checkout instead. Changes take effect after `npm run b"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"uild` and a restart:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`dsh plugin` forwards to pnpm inside the profile directory and keeps the profile's `dsh.profile.bund"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"les` list in step, so no manual registration is needed."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The plugin registers server-side agent tools. It also ships a small browser half that draws the cand"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"lestick chart described under `get_history`; in a TUI or headless profile that half is simply absent"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" and every tool still works."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Tool | Returns |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `get_quote` | Last price, change, day range, volume, market cap, P/E, EPS, book value, dividend yi"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"eld, 52-week range, moving averages, last and next earnings dates. For an ETF or mutual fund, also e"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"xpense ratio, net assets, category, allocation, trailing returns and top holdings |\n| `get_history` "},{"id":"p34s4","text":"| Daily/weekly/monthly OHLCV bars with adjusted close, plus dividends and splits in the window, as s"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"tructured data points |\n| `get_financials` | Income statement, balance sheet and cash flow line item"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"s, quarterly or annual, with the reporting currency and trailing-twelve-month ratios |\n| `get_analys"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"t_view` | Consensus rating, buy/hold/sell counts by month, price targets, forward EPS and revenue es"},{"id":"p34s8","text":"timates, recent broker upgrades and downgrades, EPS beat/miss history |\n| `get_news` | Recent headli"},{"id":"p34s9","text":"nes with publisher, timestamp and link |\n| `get_ownership` | Insider/institutional split, largest in"},{"id":"p34s10","text":"stitutional and fund holders with quarterly position changes, and insiders' six-month buying and sel"},{"id":"p34s11","text":"ional and fund holders with quarterly position changes, and insiders' six-month buying and selling |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### `get_quote`"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Notes |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| `ticker` | string, required | e.g. `AAPL`, `BRK-B` |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Earnings dates are reported as `last_earnings_date` and `next_earnings_date` separately, because ups"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"tream conflates them in one field. `next_earnings_date_is_estimate` marks a date projected from the "},{"id":"p38s3","text":"reporting cadence rather than confirmed by the company. Across a ten-ticker sample it was true half "},{"id":"p38s4","text":"the time, so it is worth checking rather than assuming either way."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"`currency` is what the stock trades in; `financial_currency` is what the company reports in. They di"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ffer for ADRs, and only the latter applies to the figures in `get_financials`."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Analyst ratings are deliberately not part of this tool even though upstream returns one. Consensus r"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"atings and price targets live in `get_analyst_view`, so a caller that only wants market data never h"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"as a recommendation put in front of it."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**ETFs and mutual funds** additionally return `fund_expense_ratio_percent` (with the category averag"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"e beside it), `fund_total_assets`, `fund_category`, `fund_family`, `fund_asset_allocation_percent`, "},{"id":"p41s3","text":"`fund_trailing_returns_percent` and `fund_top_holdings`. Those come from a second upstream call made"},{"id":"p41s4","text":" only when the quote says the symbol is a fund, so an equity pays nothing for them; a fund quote cos"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"ts roughly three times an equity one. If that call fails the quote is still returned, with a warning"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"s roughly three times an equity one. If that call fails the quote is still returned, with a warning."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Three things about the fund fields are stated in a `fund_notes` block in the response itself, rather"},{"id":"p42s2","text":" than only here, because whatever reads the numbers is reading the response:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- `trailing_pe`, `price_to_book`, `book_value_per_share` and `eps_trailing_twelve_months` are holdin"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"gs-weighted aggregates for a fund, not one company's figures. Left unlabelled, they get read as a va"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"luation judgement on the fund.\n- The expense ratio is passed through as reported and is occasionally"},{"id":"p43s4","text":" wrong — FXAIX was observed at 0.42% against a true 0.015%.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### `get_history`"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Notes |"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| `ticker` | string, required | |\n| `range` | enum | `5d` `1mo` `3mo` `6mo` `1y` `2y` `5y` `10y` `ma"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"x`. Default `1y` |\n| `start_date` / `end_date` | string | `yyyy-MM-dd`; `start_date` overrides `rang"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"1y` |\n| `start_date` / `end_date` | string | `yyyy-MM-dd`; `start_date` overrides `range` |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
